 A command-line GPIO control utility for BeagleBone Black that supports
 chaining commands, multiple output modes, and comprehensive pin mapping.
 .
 Features:
  - Support for all P8 and P9 GPIO pins
  - Command chaining with delays
  - Multiple output modes (verbose, report, quiet)
  - Pull-up/pull-down resistor control
